Third-party data

data/pii_corpus.jsonl is the synthetic corpus of the turkish-pii-redactor
project (https://github.com/fevziegeyurtsevenler/turkish-pii-redactor),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; 11 of its 155 lines were
modified in this repository (see data/pii_corpus.SOURCES.md). The upstream
NOTICE file reads:

    turkish-pii-redactor
    Copyright 2026 Fevzi Ege Yurtsevenler

    This product includes software developed by Fevzi Ege Yurtsevenler.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

data/ml_testset_ref.jsonl holds the "Goal" texts of the JailbreakBench
JBB-Behaviors dataset (https://huggingface.co/datasets/JailbreakBench/JBB-Behaviors),
released by its authors under the MIT License (see
data/ml_testset_ref.SOURCES.md). It is not part of the published crate.

src/pii/locales/tr/places.rs is generated from the province and district
names of the turkiye-api datasets (https://github.com/ubeydeozdmr/turkiye-api,
commit a0ad8351cb52153e7a92aa7ba9a5bc1e3294da8d), Copyright (c) 2022-2026
Ubeyde Emir Özdemir, released under the MIT License. The full MIT licence
text is reproduced verbatim in data/tr_places.SOURCES.md, together with
the file checksums and the transformation applied.

src/pii/locales/tr/person_names.txt (Turkish first and last names with
frequency classes) is derived from mkozturk/trnames
(https://github.com/mkozturk/trnames, commit 8bc31fafc71a090dcc6f80c540b8cfac84129ab1),
released under the MIT License, reproduced verbatim below (see
src/pii/locales/tr/person_lexicon.SOURCES.md):

